e New Orleans experiment and school  choice will succeed over the long term  but early results are promising and for  the first time in decades people are  optimistic about the future of the New  Orleans educational system those up  close personal to this reform know that  we are onto something  powerful my main message to each of my  children  as they grow up will be never be  satisfied with mediocrity in a classroom  if your teacher is not teaching let them  know I'm here to learn they said no  matter how poor you are or matter who  you is or when you come from you can go  to college I don't think it takes a  natural disaster but I do think it takes  a radical shift in thinking I believe  within the next couple of years we're  going to outperform the suburban parish  that abuts of New Orleans  and when we do that there'll be a little  mini earthquake it's a very exciting  amazing thing to be a part of really  amazing
 

